      "description": "🌟 Step up your street style with our Washed Letter Embroidered Baseball Cap—where hip-hop edge meets sun-safe functionality for all!​\n\n🧢 Product Features: Crafted from soft, breathable cotton, this adjustable cap features retro washed letter embroidery and a curved \"duckbill\" brim, delivering a bold personalized street aesthetic. The one-size-fits-most design (adjustable strap fits 56-60cm) suits men and women, while the dome-shaped crown and UV-protective brim shield against harsh rays during outdoor adventures, beach trips, or urban explorations.\n\n✨Perfect for hip-hop enthusiasts, trendsetters, and anyone seeking a statement accessory that blends fashion with sun protection—pair with streetwear, athleisure, or casual outfits to elevate any look.​\n\n📸 Important Notes: Color and embroidery texture may vary slightly due to monitor settings. Minor strap adjustment deviations (1-2cm) are normal for customizable fits—part of its user-friendly design.",
